  "description": "Generic CRUD service over Muslim.GenericRepository.Interface: Service<TEntity> implements IService<TEntity> (Muslim.GenericService.Interface) and wraps every repository read, write, soft delete, bulk operation and count, validate DTOs with Muslim.Validator, and return Muslim.Result Result<T> instead of throwing.",
  "id": "Muslim.GenericService",
  "isPrerelease": false,
