  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/mazen1998m/Muslim",
  "published": "2026-10-15T13:53:21.557Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "IService<TEntity> and its part interfaces moved to the new Muslim.GenericService.Interface package (same namespaces, type-forwarded); Service<TEntity> is split into partial files. Find(filter)/FindAsync(filter) no longer fail with \"Missing map from X to X\"; FindAsync page counts now count matching rows instead of the whole table; FindAsync(condition) returns a failed Result instead of throwing; DeleteRangeByIdsAsync and SoftDeleteRange* no longer report success as failure or carry a spurious \"not found\" error; CreateRange/CreateRangeAsync catch database errors; UpdateRange/UpdateRangeAsync enumerate once and detach every saved row; DTO validation uses the current Muslim.Inject request scope; a missing repository gives a descriptive error. Ships version-matched agent guidance and generates .agents/skills/muslim-genericservice during normal consuming builds; preserves user files and supports MuslimGenericServiceGenerateSkill=false. See CHANGELOG.md and README.md.",
